#
msgid ""
msgstr "Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "Add Rule"
msgstr "Lisa Reegel"

msgid ""
"Add rules to define which profile and entity the user will receive based on "
"their email domain (Optional)."
msgstr ""
"Lisage reeglid, et määratleda, millise profiili ja üksuse kasutaja oma "
"e-posti domeeni põhjal saab (Valikuline)."

msgid "Automatically create users on first login"
msgstr "Loo kasutajad automaatselt esimesel sisselogimisel"

msgid "Configuration updated."
msgstr "Konfiguratsioon on värskendatud."

msgid "Default Rule (Fallback)"
msgstr "Vaikereegel (Varuvariant)"

msgid "Default entity (ELSE)"
msgstr "Vaikimisi üksus (MUIDU)"

msgid "Default profile (ELSE)"
msgstr "Vaikimisi profiil (MUIDU)"

msgid "Domain (after @)"
msgstr "Domeen (pärast @ märk)"

msgid "Entity"
msgstr "Üksus"

msgid "Failed to create the user in GLPI."
msgstr "Kasutaja loomine GLPI-s ebaõnnestus."

msgid "Google SSO"
msgstr "Google SSO"

msgid "Google SSO — Configuration"
msgstr "Google SSO — Konfiguratsioon"

msgid "Google authentication failed: %s"
msgstr "Google'i autentimine ebaõnnestus: %s"

msgid "Google login cancelled: %s"
msgstr "Google'i sisselogimine tühistatud: %s"

msgid "Google response without authorization code."
msgstr "Google'i vastus ilma autoriseerimiskoodita."

msgid ""
"If the user email does not match any of the rules above, this profile and "
"entity will be used. Mandatory if automatic creation is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Kui kasutaja e-posti aadress ei vasta ühelegi ülaltoodud reeglile, "
"kasutatakse seda profiili ja üksust. Kohustuslik, kui automaatne loomine on "
"lubatud."

msgid "Invalid OAuth2 state. Try again from the login page."
msgstr "Kehtetu OAuth2 olek. Proovige sisselogimislehelt uuesti."

msgid "Leave blank to keep current secret (stored encrypted)."
msgstr ""
"Jätke tühjaks, et säilitada praegune saladus (salvestatud krüpteeritult)."

msgid "No GLPI user corresponds to this Google account."
msgstr "Sellele Google'i kontole ei vasta ükski GLPI kasutaja."

msgid "Only accounts from the %s domain are accepted."
msgstr "Vastu võetakse ainult domeeni %s kontod."

msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Profiil"

msgid "Profile and Entity Rules by Domain"
msgstr "Profiili ja Üksuse Reeglid Domeeni Järgi"

msgid "Register this Redirect URI in Google Cloud Console:"
msgstr "Registreerige see ümbersuunamise URI Google Cloud Console'is:"

msgid "Restrict to domain (optional)"
msgstr "Piirata domeeniga (valikuline)"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Salvesta"

msgid "Select..."
msgstr "Vali..."

msgid "Session not initialized: user has no enabled profile."
msgstr "Seanssi ei ole initsialiseeritud: kasutajal puudub aktiivne profiil."

msgid "Sign in with Google"
msgstr "Logi sisse Google'iga"

msgid "The Google account does not have a verified email."
msgstr "Google'i kontol puudub kinnitatud e-kiri."

msgid "This user is deactivated in GLPI."
msgstr "See kasutaja on GLPI-s deaktiveeritud."

msgid "or"
msgstr "või"

msgid ""
"Leave the option <strong>\"Remove domain of logins in form "
"login@domain\"</strong> as <strong>No</strong>. If enabled, users with the "
"same prefix in different providers (e.g., admin@gmail.com and "
"admin@institution.edu.br) will suffer account overlap."
msgstr ""
"Jätke valik <strong>„Eemalda sisselogimiste domeen kujul "
"login@domeen”</strong> väärtuseks <strong>Ei</strong>. Kui see on lubatud, "
"kattuvad kasutajad, kellel on eri pakkujatel sama eesliide (nt "
"admin@gmail.com ja admin@institution.edu.br)."

msgid ""
"Check the <strong>Activate \"Sign in with Google\" button</strong> option "
"below and click <strong>Save</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Märkige allpool valik <strong>Aktiveeri nupp „Logi sisse "
"Google'iga”</strong> ja klõpsake käsul <strong>Salvesta</strong>."

msgid ""
"Change the <strong>Automatically add users from an external authentication "
"source</strong> field to <strong>Yes</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Muutke välja <strong>Lisa automaatselt kasutajad välisest "
"autentimisallikast</strong> väärtuseks <strong>Jah</strong>."

msgid "Step 1: Google Cloud Preparation"
msgstr "1. samm: Google'i pilve ettevalmistamine"

msgid "Critical Warning:"
msgstr "Kriitiline hoiatus:"

msgid "How to enable Google SSO integration?"
msgstr "Kuidas lubada Google'i SSO-integratsiooni?"

msgid ""
"Google will generate a <strong>Client ID</strong> and a <strong>Client "
"Secret</strong>. Fill in the fields in this form with those keys."
msgstr ""
"Google loob <strong>kliendi ID</strong> ja <strong>kliendi "
"saladuse</strong>. Täitke selle vormi väljad nende võtmetega."

msgid ""
"Access the <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Google Cloud Console</a> and create a new "
"<strong>Project</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Juurdepääs <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Google Cloud Console'ile</a> ja looge uus "
"<strong>projekt</strong>."

msgid "Redirect URI:"
msgstr "Ümbersuunamise URI:"

msgid "Activate \"Sign in with Google\" button"
msgstr "Aktiveerige nupp \"Logi sisse Google'iga\"."

msgid ""
"Then go to <strong>Credentials &gt; Create Credentials &gt; OAuth client "
"ID</strong>, choosing the <strong>Web application</strong> type."
msgstr ""
"Seejärel avage <strong>Mandaat &gt; Loo mandaadid &gt; OAuthi kliendi "
"ID</strong>, valides tüübi <strong>Veebirakenduse</strong>."

msgid "Step 2: GLPI Authentication Preparation"
msgstr "2. samm: GLPI autentimise ettevalmistamine"

msgid ""
"Go to <strong>APIs &amp; Services &gt; OAuth consent screen</strong> and "
"configure your app (add the scopes <code>email</code>, <code>profile</code>,"
" and <code>openid</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Avage <strong>API-d &amp; Teenused &gt; OAuthi nõusoleku kuva</strong> ja "
"seadistage oma rakendus (lisage ulatused <code>e-post</code>, "
"<code>profiil</code> ja <code>avatud</code>)."

msgid "In GLPI, go to <strong>Setup &gt; Authentication &gt; Setup</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Avage GLPI-s <strong>Seadistamine &gt; Autentimine &gt; "
"Seadistamine</strong>."

msgid ""
"Under <strong>Authorized redirect URIs</strong>, copy and paste exactly the "
"return URL below:"
msgstr ""
"Kopeerige ja kleepige jaotises <strong>Lubatud ümbersuunamise URI-d</strong>"
" täpselt allolev tagastus-URL:"

msgid ""
"Subdomains are also accepted. E.g.: \"company.com\" will allow "
"user@company.com and user@sub.company.com."
msgstr ""
"Vastu võetakse ka alamdomeene. Nt: \"company.com\" lubab user@company.com ja"
" user@sub.company.com."

msgid ""
"To test the account creation rules and discover which Profile/Entity will be"
" assigned to an email,"
msgstr ""
"Konto loomise reeglite testimiseks ja teada saamiseks, milline profiil/üksus"
" meilisõnumile määratakse,"

msgid ""
"The plugin calls <code>Session::init()</code>. The GLPI core loads the "
"user\\'s profiles and starts the session. The user is redirected to the "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Pistikprogramm kutsub <code>Session::init()</code>. GLPI tuum laadib "
"kasutaja profiilid ja alustab seanssi. Kasutaja suunatakse armatuurlauale."

msgid "Error Creating Account"
msgstr "Viga konto loomisel"

msgid "No Profile Configured"
msgstr "Profiili pole konfigureeritud"

msgid "Database Search"
msgstr "Otsing andmebaasist"

msgid "Do you wish to proceed and create your account now?"
msgstr "Kas soovite jätkata ja kohe oma konto luua?"

msgid "click here"
msgstr "klõpsake siin"

msgid "Auto Creation Disabled"
msgstr "Automaatne loomine on keelatud"

msgid "Rules Simulator"
msgstr "Reeglite simulaator"

msgid ""
"The system would log into the existing account <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)."
" No new account would be created."
msgstr ""
"Süsteem logiks sisse olemasolevale kontole <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d). Uut"
" kontot ei looda."

msgid "▶️ Simulate Login"
msgstr "▶️ Simuleeri sisselogimist"

msgid ""
"Extracted domain: <strong>@%s</strong>. Applied rule: <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Ekstraheeritud domeen: <strong>@%s</strong>. Rakendatud reegel: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Configuration Read"
msgstr "Konfiguratsiooni lugemine"

msgid "User \"%s\" already exists. Login would be performed successfully."
msgstr "Kasutaja \"%s\" on juba olemas. Sisselogimine toimub edukalt."

msgid ""
"The email domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" is not allowed. The plugin "
"restricts access to the domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" or its subdomains."
msgstr ""
"Meili domeen \"<strong>%s</strong>\" pole lubatud. Pistikprogramm piirab "
"juurdepääsu domeenile „<strong>%s</strong>” või selle alamdomeenidele."

msgid ""
"The plugin calls <code>User::add()</code> to create the user "
"\"<strong>%s</strong>\"."
msgstr ""
"Pistikprogramm kutsub <code>User::add()</code> kasutaja "
"\"<strong>%s</strong> loomiseks\"."

msgid "using the primary email:"
msgstr "kasutades esmast e-posti aadressi:"

msgid "User::add() called"
msgstr "Kasutaja::add() kutsus"

msgid "Profile Determined by Plugin"
msgstr "Plugina poolt määratud profiil"

msgid ""
"Profile: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d) | Entity: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"
msgstr ""
"Profiil: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d) | Üksus: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"

msgid ""
"The email domain \"<strong>%s</strong>\" is allowed by the restriction rule."
msgstr "Meilidomeen \"<strong>%s</strong>\" on piirangureegliga lubatud."

msgid "Core Default Profile Assigned"
msgstr "Põhiline vaikeprofiil on määratud"

msgid "Verified email present: <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Olemas kinnitatud e-post: <strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "The user \"%s\" DOES NOT exist and auto-creation is disabled."
msgstr "Kasutajat \"%s\" EI OLE ja automaatne loomine on keelatud."

msgid "Profile Correction by Plugin"
msgstr "Profiiliparandus plugina abil"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Jah"

msgid "To access the system via Google, a new account will be created for"
msgstr "Süsteemile Google'i kaudu juurdepääsuks luuakse uus konto"

msgid "Rule Used"
msgstr "Kasutatud reegel"

msgid "Plugin googlesso step"
msgstr "Plugin googlesso samm"

msgid "Simulator:"
msgstr "Simulaator:"

msgid "Account Creation Required"
msgstr "Nõutav konto loomine"

msgid "Domain Rule for \"%s\""
msgstr "Domeeni reegel \"%s\" jaoks"

msgid ""
"This simulator faithfully reproduces the entire execution chain — from the "
"plugin logic to the internal GLPI Core behavior. Enter an email and see "
"step-by-step what would happen in a real login."
msgstr ""
"See simulaator reprodutseerib tõetruult kogu täitmisahelat – alates "
"pistikprogrammi loogikast kuni sisemise GLPI Core käitumiseni. Sisestage "
"meiliaadress ja vaadake samm-sammult, mis juhtuks päris sisselogimisel."

msgid "Back to configuration"
msgstr "Tagasi konfiguratsiooni juurde"

msgid "Account Creation Confirmation"
msgstr "Konto loomise kinnitus"

msgid "Domain Rules"
msgstr "Domeenireeglid"

msgid "Account Creation Simulator"
msgstr "Konto loomise simulaator"

msgid "No"
msgstr "Ei"

msgid "No user found with the email <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "E-posti aadressiga <strong>%s</strong> ei leitud ühtegi kasutajat"

msgid "Login / Email"
msgstr "Sisselogimine / e-post"

msgid ""
"The \"Automatically create users\" configuration is "
"<strong>DISABLED</strong>. The login would be blocked."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguratsioon „Loo kasutajad automaatselt” on <strong>KEELATUD</strong>. "
"Sisselogimine oleks blokeeritud."

msgid "(none)"
msgstr "(mitte ükski)"

msgid "Login blocked: Only accounts from the %s domain are accepted."
msgstr ""
"Sisselogimine blokeeritud: aktsepteeritakse ainult kontosid domeenist %s."

msgid "The user \"%s\" would be created successfully."
msgstr "Kasutaja \"%s\" loomine õnnestub."

msgid ""
"The plugin removes the incorrect profiles assigned by GLPI and explicitly "
"links the profile <strong>%s</strong> and entity <strong>%s</strong> using "
"the <code>Profile_User</code> class."
msgstr ""
"Pistikprogramm eemaldab GLPI määratud valed profiilid ja lingib "
"selgesõnaliselt profiili <strong>%s</strong> ja olemi <strong>%s</strong>, "
"kasutades klassi <code>Profile_User</code>."

msgid "Email Validation"
msgstr "Meili kinnitamine"

msgid "User found by email: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"
msgstr "Kasutaja leitud meili teel: <strong>%s</strong> (ID: %d)"

msgid "Domain Restriction Check"
msgstr "Domeenipiirangu kontroll"

msgid "None"
msgstr "Mitte ühtegi"

msgid "Session::init() — Login Performed"
msgstr "Seanss::init() — sisselogimine sooritatud"

msgid "Execution Chain (Step-by-Step)"
msgstr "Täitmisahel (samm-sammult)"

msgid "Login to Existing Account"
msgstr "Logige sisse olemasolevale kontole"

msgid "How it works:"
msgstr "Kuidas see toimib:"

msgid ""
"In GLPI 11, the core ignores the profile passed by external authentications "
"and automatically assigns the global default profile (usually Self-Service) "
"to the new user."
msgstr ""
"GLPI 11-s ignoreerib tuum välise autentimise kaudu edastatud profiili ja "
"määrab uuele kasutajale automaatselt globaalse vaikeprofiili (tavaliselt "
"iseteeninduse)."

msgid "Final Entity"
msgstr "Lõplik üksus"

msgid "Final Result"
msgstr "Lõpptulemus"

msgid "Back to Login"
msgstr "Tagasi sisselogimise juurde"

msgid "Simulated Email:"
msgstr "Simuleeritud e-post:"

msgid ""
"Restrict domain: <strong>%s</strong> | Auto create users: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Piira domeen: <strong>%s</strong> | Kasutajate automaatne loomine: "
"<strong>%s</strong>"

msgid "Final Profile"
msgstr "Lõplik profiil"

msgid ""
"The user \"%s\" would be created, but without ANY profile. Access to GLPI "
"would be denied. Please configure a valid profile in the Default Rule or "
"Domain Rules."
msgstr ""
"Kasutaja \"%s\" luuakse, kuid ilma ÜHTEGI profiilita. Juurdepääs GLPI-le "
"oleks keelatud. Seadistage vaikereeglis või domeenireeglis kehtiv profiil."

msgid "GLPI Core step"
msgstr "GLPI Core samm"

msgid ""
"No valid profile (ID > 0) was found in the plugin rules. The user would be "
"created WITHOUT a profile."
msgstr ""
"Plugina reeglitest ei leitud ühtegi kehtivat profiili (ID > 0). Kasutaja "
"luuakse ILMA profiilita."
